## Tech stack

- Next.js (App Router) + TypeScript strict — `src/` layout, `@/*` import alias
{{#if (eq styling 'ui-core')}}
- Tailwind CSS v4 + `@cleeviox/ui-core` — use `cn()` and components from the package
{{/if}}
{{#if (eq styling 'shadcn')}}
- Tailwind CSS v4 + shadcn/ui — add components with `npx shadcn add <name>`; `cn()` lives in `src/lib/utils.ts`
{{/if}}
{{#if (eq styling 'tailwind-only')}}
- Tailwind CSS v4
{{/if}}
{{#if (eq data 'tanstack-query')}}
- TanStack Query — client cache in `src/lib/query-client.ts`, provider tree in `src/app/providers.tsx`
{{/if}}
{{#if (eq data 'tanstack-query-zustand')}}
- TanStack Query (server data, `src/lib/query-client.ts`) + Zustand (client-owned state, `src/stores/`) — keep server data OUT of Zustand
{{/if}}
{{#if (eq data 'server-actions')}}
- Server Actions only — no client data layer; add one deliberately if needed
{{/if}}
{{#if (eq auth 'workos')}}
- WorkOS AuthKit — session proxy in `src/proxy.ts`, OAuth callback at `src/app/callback/route.ts`; WORKOS_* env vars required
{{/if}}
{{#if (eq auth 'firebase')}}
- Firebase Auth — client init in `src/lib/firebase.ts`; NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_* env vars required
{{/if}}
{{#if (includes addons 'docker')}}
- Docker — multi-stage build against Next.js standalone output (`Dockerfile`)
{{/if}}
{{#if (includes addons 'storybook')}}
- Storybook — config in `.storybook/`, stories co-located as `*.stories.tsx`
{{/if}}
{{#if (includes addons 'playwright')}}
- Playwright — E2E specs in `e2e/`
{{/if}}
- Biome (lint + format), knip, lint-staged + husky — all extend `@cleeviox/*` config packages

## Commands

- `{{packageManager}} run dev` — dev server
- `{{packageManager}} run build` — production build
- `{{packageManager}} run ts` — typecheck (run after non-trivial changes)
- `{{packageManager}} run check` — Biome lint + format check (`check:fix` to write)
